From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WWWorm <noreply@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:28:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add Streamline on Vulkan as a graphics SDK owner

Windows only, enabled with use_streamline=yes vulkan=yes. The interposer
is loaded from the executable directory after its signature is checked.
The owner is chosen before the rendering context is created from
user://graphics_sdk.cfg or --graphics-sdk=nvidia; headless runs never
initialize it.
---
